&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in high-density compute, AI/ML infrastructure, or liquid cooling environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with hyperscalers or data center operators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with edge computing, digital twins, and smart infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
