&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to shape the future of next-gen data center infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work at the intersection of IT, OT, and advanced computing technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global impact in a fast-growing, innovative environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct involvement in high-impact, strategic deals at the forefront of AI infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
